# Every atom of one residue against every atom of another per frame: v1's distance_pair is VIAL's distance over a new
# axis, flattened to v1's layout (b varying fastest)
# data: 1ALA-560ns.pdb
=== v1
dp = distance_pair(residue(1), residue(2));
=== vial
dp = flatten(distance(residue[0].xyz[:, None], residue[1].xyz))
